      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "JER",
          "chapter": 39,
          "verse": 12
        }
      ],
      "en": "“Take him and take care of him. Do him no harm; but do to him even as he tells you.”",
      "ko": "그를 데려다가 선대하고 해하지 말며 그가 네게 말하는대로 행하라",
      "source_text_hash": "c4de03ee70bf04a8c6e0b926ca75a16f1cb99c434e495245d6426c46e2db74f2",
      "translation_text_hash": "24958dbe4fc24791bcd8b06569576155dafde91b9d39db90337d4affe75893a2",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "그를 데려다가 선대하고 해하지 말며 그가 네게 말하는대로 행하라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "24958dbe4fc24791bcd8b06569576155dafde91b9d39db90337d4affe75893a2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:JER:39:13",
      "sequence": 19937,
      "chapter_label": "JER 39",
