      "en": "Now the LORD’s word came to Jeremiah while he was shut up in the court of the guard, saying,",
      "ko": "예레미야가 시위대 뜰에 갇혔을 때에 여호와의 말씀이 그에게 임하니라 가라사대",
      "source_text_hash": "be458411a58ed6f72968d6b12ccbab2166f3db1ad71782fcc05b1343ee46003e",
      "translation_text_hash": "ea4745bc6627c774d272ca2c4b4853527aa4351389c2d2d02bd6f0a59604234f",
